# House Hlaalu: joining, then Nileno Dorvayn's first duties in the Hlaalu Council Manor, Balmora.
# Joining asks Speed and Agility 30 (MorrowindRuntime's FACT table); SetSpeed and SetAgility stand in for level-up
# choices. "Disguise" (HH_DisguisedArmor): "business" -> "say that again" ("Yes." 1: 10 or 11 by gender, and a
# disfigured Redoran's helm); worn, the helm passes Neminda in Ald'ruhn's Redoran Council Entrance ("Orphan of
# Arnesia": 50, her orders) and Nileno pays for them ("Yes, here it is." 1: 100). "Alchemical Formulas"
# (HH_IndEsp1): formulas lifted from Aurane Frernis' Vivec shop (100). "Inanius Egg Mine" (HH_EggMine): the
# kwama queen killed (100).
# `approach` stands in for the travel; the take for lifting the formulas; the kill for the fight.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case hh_join
run
player->SetSpeed 30
player->SetAgility 30
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask business
ask join House Hlaalu
choose 1
expect player->GetPCRank Hlaalu >= 0
bye
end

case hh_disguise_start
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask business
ask say that again
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_DisguisedArmor >= 10
expect player->GetItemCount "Bonemold_Gah-Julan_HHDA" == 1
bye
end

case hh_disguise_neminda
run
player->Equip "Bonemold_Gah-Julan_HHDA"
approach 05438C44
talk neminda
ask Orphan of Arnesia
expect GetJournalIndex HH_DisguisedArmor == 50
expect player->GetItemCount "bk_NemindasOrders" == 1
bye
end

case hh_disguise_done
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask Orphan of Arnesia
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_DisguisedArmor == 100
bye
end

case hh_formulas
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask business
ask alchemical formulas
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp1 == 10
bye
approach 05928FF0
take 0555047C
until 300 player->GetItemCount "bk_auranefrernis2" >= 1
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask alchemical formulas
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex HH_IndEsp1 == 100
bye
end

case hh_eggmine
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask business
ask Inanius egg mine
expect GetJournalIndex HH_EggMine == 10
bye
approach 057B5992
defend
console 057B5992.kill
wait 60
approach 0549AC23
talk nileno dorvayn
ask Inanius egg mine
expect GetJournalIndex HH_EggMine == 100
bye
end
